,0.0,0.0,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"There she is, at the end of the dock. Most landlubbers wouldn't even know it was here, not having much day-to-day use for docks, or for ships like yours. The Sea Cat, a three-masted schooner with all the mod cons – the crew insisted on Wi-Fi and television.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":16.416,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":51,"words":51},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":16.416,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":51,"words":51},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"The coat of arms you completed at your last stop will get printed on its flag so it can fly proudly over her. Speaking of which, you might as well send it to your printer now and share it to social media while you’re at it. You’ve got to fly your flag literally and digitally these days, don’t ya know.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":16.928,"end":32.48,"frac":0.983,"status":"ok","matched":59,"words":60},"large":{"start":16.928,"end":32.48,"frac":0.983,"status":"ok","matched":59,"words":60},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"Time to show off your finished pirate coat of arms proudly! Share to social with the hashtag #apiratecaptain and #pirateslife","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":33.12,"end":41.472,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"large":{"start":33.12,"end":40.9,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":20},"differ":true}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/69052809549f1_PC%20JM13_boat_only.png"}